The **Indebted Yakuza** owes his life to his crime family, so he has
become a loyal and honored member of it -- though all he really wants
is to stay away from violence. The conflict between the two sides of
him torments him. *Attack (Illegal Firearm) +2, Intimidating +2,
Knowledge (Gambling) +2, Tough +1; Bizarre Appearance (Full-Body
Tattoos) −1, Pacifist −1, Servitude (Yakuza) −3.*

